    "reference_values": "The upstream quadpack test asserts sin integral=2 and the n=2,z=1.8 Bessel integral=0.30614353532540296487. Those are driver-level published fixtures, applied here to a smooth single panel with declared tolerances. Supplemental polynomial expectations are analytically integrated, not upstream literal gold."
